msgid "miniworlds-robot"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/robot/index.md:3
msgid ""
"**miniworlds-robot** provides a grid-based robot world for teaching "
"algorithmic thinking. Students write code that moves a robot through a "
"`TiledWorld`, collecting leaves and navigating obstacles, without having "
"access to the full miniworlds API surface."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/libraries/robot/index.md:7
msgid ""
"The library enforces an intentionally limited robot *ability set* that "
"you configure per world, so each exercise reveals exactly the language "
"features needed for that lesson."
msgstr ""

